src/run_pipeline.py
- Loads YAML, creates Delta-enabled UTC Spark, orchestrates stages and writes atomic local JSON reports.
- run_id uses a UTC timestamp plus a UUID fragment; it is different from the human-readable run01 directory name.
- Validation cutoff is frozen for a run/retry.
- Writes quarantine to a deterministic subdirectory based on source content plus validation rules, using an overwrite of that per-batch Delta table. This does not append a new duplicate quarantine table on identical replay.
